  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.75,
    "y": 10.004166666666666,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.442222222222222,
    "text": "This summer's work tests feature-based specialization against the global predictor, adds consistent assignment for known stations, and examines how missing routing inputs affect estimates at new sensor sites.",
    "lines": [
      "This summer's work tests feature-based specialization against the",
