    "y": 17.651944444444442,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.442222222222222,
    "text": "NOAA USCRN and SNOTEL supply in-situ observations. Inputs combine SMAP moisture, Sentinel radar and optical measurements, MODIS temperature and vegetation, ERA5-Land weather, and terrain, climate, land-cover, and soil descriptors.",
    "lines": [
      "NOAA USCRN and SNOTEL supply in-situ observations. Inputs combine",
      "SMAP moisture, Sentinel radar and optical measurements, MODIS",
      "temperature and vegetation, ERA5-Land weather, and terrain, climate,",
      "land-cover, and soil descriptors."
