    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.442222222222222,
    "text": "The pipeline aligns sources daily, fills observation gaps, smooths the series, and derives recent-history features. Both approaches receive identical prepared inputs, keeping the comparison focused on grouping and assignment.",
    "lines": [
